##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# Spec 027 (T023): generates the deep shadow map fixture of TextureSystem_StreamCursor at test
# time. No deep shadow map is committed (maintainer decision 2026-10-27); the test renders this
# one-tile scene through the "tsm" display driver into its working directory, then looks the map
# up as a deep shadow. 32x32 pixels, 16x16 buckets (the tsm driver needs square power-of-two
# buckets and the reyes hider), one translucent sphere.
version 3.03
Hider "reyes"
Option "limits" "numthreads" [1]
Option "limits" "bucketsize" [16 16]
Display "deep-shadow-fixture.tsm" "tsm" "z"
Format 32 32 1
PixelSamples 2 2
Projection "orthographic"
Clipping 0.1 100
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
  Opacity [0.5 0.5 0.5]
  Surface "constant"
  Sphere 0.8 -0.8 0.8 360
WorldEnd
